  "description": "A comprehensive core statistics library for .NET providing essential mathematical statistics functions \n      for real-valued numerical data. FTI.Statistics offers robust statistical analysis capabilities including \n      descriptive statistics, central tendency measures, dispersion analysis, correlation, linear regression, \n      and data distribution functions.\n\n      Key Features:\n      • Central Tendency: Mean, Median, Mode, Geometric/Harmonic means\n      • Dispersion: Variance, Standard Deviation, Range, Interquartile Range\n      • Distribution: Quantiles, Percentiles, Summary statistics\n      • Relationships: Correlation (Pearson/Spearman), Covariance, Linear Regression\n      • Advanced: Kernel Density Estimation, Normal Distribution, Beta/Gamma functions\n      • Utilities: Comprehensive input validation and robust error handling\n\n      Perfect for business analytics, data science, research, and educational applications.",
  "id": "FTI.Statistics",
